{"v":4,"catch":"該遊戲是對 1980 年代中期的 Run \"N Gun 遊戲（Commando、Ikari Warrior、Heavy Barrel、Guerilla Wars、Mercs...）的致敬，您可以在街機或 16 位遊戲機上找到這些遊戲。","desc":"在這款向 80 年代街機遊戲致敬的遊戲中，重溫復古的 Run \"N Gun 體驗。\n\n您必須單獨或與其他玩家一起擊敗可怕的赫克托將軍並解救被扣為人質的士兵。\n穿越 11 個不同的關卡，面對許多敵人、坦克、直升機、飛機……\n提高你的火力；使用你的手榴彈在關卡結束時擊敗不同的老闆。\n避開不同的陷阱（礦井、洞口）並面對反覆無常的氣候（冰、熔岩......）。\n遊戲包含 9 個 2D 關卡和 2 個 3D 縮放關卡（Space Harrier 風格）。\n可以同時與 2 名玩家一起玩。","publisher":"Consulog","release":"2022-09-29","genres":["街機","動作","射擊","派對"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e688e992745e531cd292d748c1ae2d52f17411c4396f7e2f3b9eedbe8f88566c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2faa85a050f8029feeab2357890c3ecde272c20d3c14d3736ea4e6b39f109918.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d6eae689042796597354cb17d6e9e51b9e2b339d20ad1777a6800694ac8aead.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7fd4a383be6e42869e6d05c066a93b28bfe264434095541cb746ad23ce9c712b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/07338989a646d59bb15e97b2c41bbfe39e3fcab0b2d0f591f0743648599fd6f5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/887cd9455f74aae1e457a1401de04af98b8bdde9726dac49ddc92038c0585264.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e0b017fa2000","dlc":[]}